                <pb facs="0108" n="98" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg98"/>

                <head>Appendix 45</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Resolution of Finance Section
                        Regarding Communication With Austria</hi></p>
                <p>That the Financial Sub-Commission should invite the Supreme Economic Council to
                    communicate through Berne to the Austrian Government the arrangements which have
                    been made for the revictualling of German Austria.</p>
            </div>
